<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>本草经中经 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%BB%8F/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 22 May 2025 10:04:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%BB%8F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>一四四、石硫黄</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/144-shiliuhuang/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 May 2025 10:04:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/144-shiliuhuang/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%BB%8F/">本草经中经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;市面上有两种，一个是石硫磺，一个是土硫磺，土硫磺是褐色剧毒，不会内服，一般和铜在一起用作伤科止痛；能内服的是石硫磺，淡黄色，像刚出生的小鸡的颜色。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>一四三、雄黄</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/143-xionghuang/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 May 2025 10:03:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/143-xionghuang/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%AD%E7%BB%8F/">本草经中经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;是中经的第一味药，雄黄如上图就是石头，佩戴在身上可以辟邪，因为雄黄气味很重，阳气很强的，能令虫蛇不近身。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味苦平寒、主寒热鼠瘘，恶创疽痔死肌，杀精恶物鬼邪气，百虫毒，胜五兵，炼食之，轻身神仙。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;雄黄解毒。可解虫蛇咬伤之毒，蜜蜂的毒也可，前面还讲过景天也能解毒，但中经的药力量更强。也就说日常养生吃上经的东西，真正生病了，要看中经。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>